  },
  "method": "the full front-end is run once at a reference timestep to produce a channel-force trace, which is then sampled by linear interpolation at each test timestep's times through a shim exposing the same channel_forces(step0, num_steps) interface the engine already calls. Every timestep integrates the identical continuous stimulus from the identical initial condition, so any KC difference is integrator error alone. The engine is not modified.",
